Package: dtptite
Title: Dose Transition Pathways for Time-to-Event Dose-Finding Designs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xiaoran", "Lai", , "xiaoran.lai@icr.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("The Institute of Cancer Research", role = "cph"),
    person("National Institute for Health and Care Research", role = "fnd")
  )
Description: Implements the Dose Transition Pathways (DTP) look-ahead strategy
    for time-to-event phase I dose-finding clinical trials with delayed or
    pending toxicity outcomes. Provides a DTP decorator for the 'escalation'
    framework, supporting both TITE-CRM (model-based) and TITE-BOIN
    (model-assisted) base designs.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/ICR-EPAT/dtptite
